    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like they \"need\" me, it feels like they're stuck carrying my weight. every time i struggle or can't provide what they need, it just drags them down with me. i just feel like a broken part in a machine that's supposed to be helping them, but i'm actually just slowing them down. it feels so selfish to keep holding on when i'm just making everything harder for them.",
